कामदु॑घ a. the same (lit. milking wishes);
successful, fortunate;
 f. आ the fabulous Wish or Wonder-cow.

कामात्मन् a. whose nature is desire, voluptuous;
 abstr.
˚त्मता f.

कामि॑न् a. wishing, desiring, longing for (acc. or —˚);
loving, affectionate, enamoured of (acc. or सार्धम्). m. a lover;
 f.
काभिनी a (loving) woman or maiden.

का॑म्य a. desirable, precious, lovely, pleasant;
 voluntary,
relating to or sprung from a certain wish, egoistical.
